{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-73286" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-73286" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /3} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})-(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}-(-1) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}+1 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-73286" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2304a2274167882c49ec2d175a7d42cd72be1571d20e251081083acb27fd3da7"} {"question" "q-73286" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-73286" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-1"] ["math" "-\\frac{1}{2}"] ["math" "0"] ["math" "1"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-73286" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{2}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103647" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "${\\int }_{-5}^{0}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103647" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-5}^{0}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={e}^{x}\\,{|}_{-5}^{0} \\\\  & ={e}^{0}-{e}^{-5} \\\\  & =1-\\frac{1}{{e}^{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103647" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2304a2274167882c49ec2d175a7d42cd72be1571d20e251081083acb27fd3da7"} {"question" "q-103647" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103647" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{1}{{e}^{5}}"] ["math" "1-\\frac{1}{{e}^{5}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{e}-\\frac{1}{{e}^{5}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{{e}^{5}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{{e}^{5}}-1"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103647" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1-\\frac{1}{{e}^{5}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103658" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate \n${\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103658" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\,{|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-(-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})) \\\\  & =-1-(-\\sqrt{2}) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}-1.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103658" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2304a2274167882c49ec2d175a7d42cd72be1571d20e251081083acb27fd3da7"} {"question" "q-103658" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103658" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-1"] ["math" "-\\sqrt{2}-1"] ["math" "1-\\sqrt{2}"] ["math" "\\sqrt{2}+1"] ["math" "\\sqrt{2}-1"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103658" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\sqrt{2}-1"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103659" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{5\\pi /6}{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031781/state.json" "file_sha256" "7a99335897a33885b7139eaa2c3a8c589f6cd00a39402ef7988d749d1abfaeca"} {"question" "q-103659" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{5\\pi /6}{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x{|}_{\\pi /2}^{5\\pi /6} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{6})-(-\\operatorname{cot}⁡